handoff, not just its components\n8ded57b dev-sync+closeout: sync global-memory, the only repo that carries memory across machines\nd59362f startup: alias skill for the front door of a work session\n--- HEAD stat ---\ncommit 3ab44672d952877798e0c348e12188a002d8c38e\nAuthor: Eric Rash <eric.rash11@gmail.com>\nDate:   Sat Sep 12 12:12:04 2026 -0500\n\n    chore: apply global skill audit\n\n Agents/AgentPersonalities.md                       |  683 --------\n Agents/AgentProfileSystem.md                       |  304 ----\n Agents/ArchitectContext.md                         |   96 --\n Agents/ArtistContext.md                            |   97 --\n Agents/CatoContext.md                              |   88 -\n Agents/ClaudeResearcherContext.md                  |  112 --\n\n=== ahead/behind ===\n## main...origin/main\n\n=== pool entries NOT in claude skills (sample) ===\nadvisor\nAgents\nanimejs\nApertureOscillation\nAphorisms\nApify\nArt\narticulation-skill\nask-matt\nAudioEditor\nbacktrack\nBeCreative\nBiasCheck\nBitterPillEngineering\nbrandkit\nBrightData\nBrowser\ncaveman\ncodebase-design\nContextSearch\ncontribute-catalog\nCouncil\nCreateCLI\ncss-animations\nDaemon\ncount:\n     248","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"b492d078-0b2d-4577-993d-75e67ae9f3ed","session_id":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main"}
