{"parentUuid":"13492ced-feb0-4cd3-a626-ec38456405cf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CeyvzextUtgMmfzrSjGbK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01GxVB6vb9KhizK9aPMwA3Hf","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-harness-agnostic-aios.md","old_string":"- [ ] **Step 2: Take the tarball**\n\n```bash\ntar czf ~/.claude/skills-archive/pre-canonical-2026-09-12.tgz \\\n  -C ~ .claude/skills .codex/skills .agents/skills\nls -lh ~/.claude/skills-archive/pre-canonical-2026-09-12.tgz\n```\n\nExpected: a non-zero-size file. `tar` may print `Removing leading '/'` — harmless.\n\n- [ ] **Step 3: Verify the tarball actually restores**\n\n```bash\nrm -rf /tmp/tartest && mkdir -p /tmp/tartest\ntar xzf ~/.claude/skills-archive/pre-canonical-2026-09-12.tgz -C /tmp/tartest\nfind -L /tmp/tartest/.claude/skills -maxdepth 2 -name SKILL.md | wc -l\nls /tmp/tartest/.agents/skills | wc -l\ntest -f /tmp/tartest/.claude/skills/_shared/config.json && echo \"_shared OK\"\n```\n\nExpected: `61`, `306`, `_shared OK`. If any is wrong, STOP — the snapshot is not a valid undo and no later task may run.\n\n- [ ] **Step 4: Record both rollback paths**\n\n```bash\ncat >> ~/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/audits/2026-09-12-pre-canonical-inventory.txt <<'EOF'\n\n=== ROLLBACK ===\n# Un-versioned folders (undoes Tasks 2-4 view changes):\nrm -rf ~/.codex/skills ~/.agents/skills\ntar xzf ~/.claude/skills-archive/pre-canonical-2026-09-12.tgz -C ~\n\n# Canonical repo (undoes anything committed to erash11/claude-skills):\ngit -C ~/.claude/skills log --oneline\ngit -C ~/.claude/skills revert <sha>    # reaches Windows on next dev-sync\nEOF\ntail -12 ~/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/audits/2026-09-12-pre-canonical-inventory.txt\n```\n\nExpected: the rollback block prints.","new_string":"- [ ] **Step 2: Take TWO separate tarballs (R2-04)**\n\nThe views and the canonical repo must never restore together. Round 2 caught this: one combined archive containing `.claude/skills/.git` would, on extraction, overlay stale repository metadata onto a migrated repo without removing the new files — leaving a half-old index that `git revert` then operates on. Two archives, two independent undos:\n\n```bash\n# Archive A - the generated views only. This is the Tasks 2-4 undo.\ntar czf ~/.claude/skills-archive/pre-canonical-VIEWS-2026-09-12.tgz \\\n  -C ~ .codex/skills .agents/skills\n\n# Archive B - a reference copy of the canonical repo, INCLUDING .git.\n# Reference only. It is NOT the rollback path; git is. See Step 4.\ntar czf ~/.claude/skills-archive/pre-canonical-CANONICAL-2026-09-12.tgz \\\n  -C ~ .claude/skills\n\nls -lh ~/.claude/skills-archive/pre-canonical-*-2026-09-12.tgz\n```\n\nExpected: two non-zero-size files. `tar` may print `Removing leading '/'` — harmless.\n\n- [ ] **Step 3: Verify each tarball independently**\n\n```bash\nrm -rf /tmp/tartest && mkdir -p /tmp/tartest/{views,canon}\n\ntar xzf ~/.claude/skills-archive/pre-canonical-VIEWS-2026-09-12.tgz -C /tmp/tartest/views\nls /tmp/tartest/views/.agents/skills | wc -l\nls /tmp/tartest/views/.codex/skills | wc -l\necho \"--- views archive must NOT contain .claude (must be empty) ---\"\nls -d /tmp/tartest/views/.claude 2>/dev/null\n\ntar xzf ~/.claude/skills-archive/pre-canonical-CANONICAL-2026-09-12.tgz -C /tmp/tartest/canon\nfind -L /tmp/tartest/canon/.claude/skills -maxdepth 2 -name SKILL.md | wc -l\ntest -f /tmp/tartest/canon/.claude/skills/_shared/config.json && echo \"_shared OK\"\ngit -C /tmp/tartest/canon/.claude/skills log --oneline -1\n```\n\nExpected: `306`, `32`, **no `.claude` directory in the views archive**, then `61`, `_shared OK`, and `3ab4467 chore: apply global skill audit`. If the views archive contains `.claude`, the separation failed — STOP, no later task may run.\n\n- [ ] **Step 4: Record the two rollback paths, kept strictly apart**\n\n```bash\ncat >> ~/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/audits/2026-09-12-pre-canonical-inventory.txt <<'EOF'\n\n=== ROLLBACK - TWO INDEPENDENT PATHS, NEVER COMBINE THEM ===\n\n# PATH 1 - the generated views (undoes Tasks 2, 3, 4 view changes).\n# Safe at any time. Touches nothing versioned.\nrm -rf ~/.codex/skills ~/.agents/skills\ntar xzf ~/.claude/skills-archive/pre-canonical-VIEWS-2026-09-12.tgz -C ~\n\n# PATH 2 - the canonical repo. USE GIT, NOT THE TARBALL.\n# Extracting the CANONICAL tarball over a migrated repo would overlay stale\n# .git metadata onto new files and corrupt the history the revert needs.\ngit -C ~/.claude/skills log --oneline\ngit -C ~/.claude/skills revert <sha>     # reaches Windows on next dev-sync\ngit -C ~/.claude/skills push\n\n# After PATH 2, the views are stale. Regenerate them, do not restore them:\nbash ~/.claude/skills/sync-to-codex.sh\n\n# The CANONICAL tarball is a reference copy for inspection only.\n# Extract it to a scratch directory, never over ~/.claude/skills.\nEOF\ntail -22 ~/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/audits/2026-09-12-pre-canonical-inventory.txt\n```\n\nExpected: the rollback block prints with both paths clearly separated."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1776,"cache_read_input_tokens":174504,"output_tokens":2979,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":542},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1776,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2979,"cache_read_input_tokens":174504,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1776,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1776},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CeyvzeLBrWBtW3nG8THv4","attribution