{"parentUuid":"60c8c510-1f9d-4053-a510-a49b1f8953df","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CeywAHbYsmyaFNEoR6hZm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019LfQqp99v1JaGewH674QfD","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-harness-agnostic-aios.md","old_string":"```bash\npython3 ~/DEV/KeystoneOS/scripts/skill-portability-check.py; echo \"baseline exit=$?\"\n\n# An empty inventory must NOT report success.\nrm -rf /tmp/emptycanon && mkdir -p /tmp/emptycanon\nHOME=/tmp/emptycanon python3 ~/DEV/KeystoneOS/scripts/skill-portability-check.py; echo \"empty exit=$?\"\n```\n\nExpected: a long FAIL list and `baseline exit=1`; then `FATAL ...` and `empty exit=2`. If the empty case prints `0 failing` and exits 0, the R7 fix is not in — stop.","new_string":"```bash\npython3 ~/DEV/KeystoneOS/scripts/skill-portability-check.py; echo \"baseline exit=$?\"\n\n# Case 1 (R7): an empty inventory must NOT report success.\nrm -rf /tmp/emptycanon && mkdir -p /tmp/emptycanon/.claude/skills\nHOME=/tmp/emptycanon python3 ~/DEV/KeystoneOS/scripts/skill-portability-check.py; echo \"empty exit=$?\"\n\n# Cases 2-4 (R2-05): negative-only, duplicate key, unbalanced quote.\nrm -rf /tmp/badcanon && mkdir -p /tmp/badcanon/.claude/skills/{negonly,dupekey,badquote}\n\ncat > /tmp/badcanon/.claude/skills/negonly/SKILL.md <<'YAML'\n---\nname: negonly\ndescription: Do not use when auditing anything at all.\n---\nbody\nYAML\n\ncat > /tmp/badcanon/.claude/skills/dupekey/SKILL.md <<'YAML'\n---\nname: dupekey\ndescription: Use when testing. Do not use otherwise.\ndescription: Use when testing again.\n---\nbody\nYAML\n\ncat > /tmp/badcanon/.claude/skills/badquote/SKILL.md <<'YAML'\n---\nname: badquote\ndescription: \"Use when testing. Do not use otherwise.\n---\nbody\nYAML\n\nHOME=/tmp/badcanon python3 ~/DEV/KeystoneOS/scripts/skill-portability-check.py; echo \"bad exit=$?\"\n```\n\nExpected:\n\n- baseline: a long FAIL list, `baseline exit=1`\n- empty: `FATAL no SKILL.md found ...`, `empty exit=2`\n- bad: **all three** named as FAIL, with `negonly` reporting *no standalone positive clause* (its only \"use when\" sits inside \"do not use when\"), `dupekey` reporting a duplicate key, `badquote` reporting an unbalanced quote — and `bad exit=1`.\n\nIf `negonly` passes, the R2-05 span-containment fix is not in. If the empty case exits 0, the R7 fix is not in. Either way, stop and fix the checker before editing a single skill — a linter that green-lights broken frontmatter is worse than none."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":881,"cache_read_input_tokens":188359,"output_tokens":1210,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":881,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1210,"cache_read_input_tokens":188359,"cache_creation_input_tokens":881,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":881},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CeywAGqenCDEakzGebr5Z","attributionSkill":"codex-review","type":"assistant","uuid":"96df3ff7-7b57-4cbb-9a9d-1e2a31127042","timestamp":"2026-09-12T17:24:40.358Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS","sessionId":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main"}
