at is not yet a rule. |"," | Hooks | `~/.claude/hooks/`, `~/.codex/hooks/` | slow | 6 months | unknown | claude-stack-doctor | Delegate. Also diff the two copies — they must match (`hook-two-copies-trap`). |","-| Memory | `~/.claude/projects/*/memory/`, `global-memory/` | medium | 1 month | unknown | improve-system | Delegate to `improve-system`. Also check `MEMORY.md` char cap. |","+| Memory (agent) | `~/.claude/projects/*/memory/`, `global-memory/` | medium | 1 month | unknown | **aios-audit itself** | Audited directly — see the delegation contract below. `improve-system` does NOT cover these stores. Check: every `MEMORY.md` index line resolves to a file; every memory file appears in its index; `global-memory/MEMORY.md` is under its 2,500-char cap; flag time-dimensioned facts (counters, \"still open\", past-tense futures). |","+| Memory (vault notes) | `~/SecondBrain/` notes | medium | 1 month | unknown | improve-system | Delegate — but read-only, per the contract below. |"," | Data feeds | Fireflies, GPS, CFBD, Zotero | varies | 1 week | unknown | os-audit | Delegate to `os-audit` Check 3 (freshness). |"," | Vault | `~/SecondBrain/` | medium | 1 month | unknown | brain-audit | Delegate to `brain-audit` (four C's score). |"," | Context posture | workspace-wide | medium | 3 months | unknown | doctor-plus | Delegate to `doctor-plus`. |"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ee652471-80da-4c19-a221-beacbc1bef74","session_id":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS","sessionId":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main"}
