{"parentUuid":"0c6e05e7-219b-4656-ad17-f7dd85310291","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CeywDmmHif9zs6a4BAMq8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EvJAympGZke6qbSy3zgnhT","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-harness-agnostic-aios.md","old_string":"## Layout invariants the audit must assert\n\n- `~/.claude/skills/` is canonical, is a git repo, and contains **no symlinks**.\n- `~/.agents/skills/` and `~/.codex/skills/` are **generated views**. A real\n  directory in either means someone edited a view instead of the source.\n- Support directories (`_shared/`) have no SKILL.md and must never be pruned.","new_string":"## Delegation contract (R2-09)\n\nA delegate is invoked **read-only**, for a **named scope**, and its receipt is\nwritten **only** for the scope it actually covered.\n\n1. **Read-only.** Before invoking a delegate, instruct it explicitly: report\n   findings, apply nothing, write no ledger, create no files. Several delegates\n   (`improve-system` among them) begin by applying previously approved proposals\n   — that must be suppressed. `aios-audit` writes only its own report and the\n   `Last audited` column.\n2. **Scope must be verified, not assumed.** A delegate's actual coverage is what\n   its body scans, not what this table wishes it scanned. `improve-system` scans\n   `~/SecondBrain/` — Notes, Knowledge, Projects. It does **not** touch\n   `~/.claude/projects/*/memory/` or `global-memory/`. Those are audited by\n   `aios-audit` directly.\n3. **A receipt covers only what was checked.** If a delegate returns findings for\n   a narrower scope than its row claims, write the date **and** a scope note, or\n   leave the row `unknown`. Never stamp a date because a delegate exited cleanly.\n\n## Layout invariants the audit must assert\n\n- `~/.claude/skills/` is canonical, is a git repo, and contains **no symlinks**.\n- `~/.agents/skills/` and `~/.codex/skills/` are **generated views**. Each carries\n  a `.generated-by-sync-to-codex` manifest. Every entry **in the manifest** must be\n  a symlink on Mac (a copy on Windows); wrong representation is drift.\n- Entries **not** in the manifest are third-party installs (`npx skills add`).\n  They are counted and reported, **never** flagged as errors and never pruned.\n- Support directories (`_shared/`) have no SKILL.md and must never be pruned."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":746,"cache_read_input_tokens":193325,"output_tokens":924,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":746,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":924,"cache_read_input_tokens":193325,"cache_creation_input_tokens":746,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":746},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CeywDm3ctfmG9fVHK33j2","attributionSkill":"codex-review","type":"assistant","uuid":"5fe4febb-6dd9-405d-867a-92b0577623a6","timestamp":"2026-09-12T17:25:26.850Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS","sessionId":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"5fe4febb-6dd9-405d-867a-92b0577623a6","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"06e7d3ba-222f-4650-8a25-521650a48509","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EvJAympGZke6qbSy3zgnhT","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-harness-agnostic-aios.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"5ac93d29-1f72-4eca-ae2a-4ba1228f23c0","timestamp":"2026-09-12T17:25:26.973Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-harness-agnostic-aios.md","oldString":"## Layout invariants the audit must assert\n\n- `~/.claude/skills/` is canonical, is a git repo, and contains **no symlinks**.\n- `~/.agents/skills/` and `~/.codex/skills/` are **generated views**. A real\n  directory in either means someone edited a view instead of the source.\n- Support directories (`_shared/`) have no SKILL.md and must never be pruned.","newString":"## Delegation contract (R2-09)\n\nA delegate is invoked **read-only**, for a **named scope**, and its receipt is\nwritten **only** for the scope it actually covered.\n\n1. **Read-only.** Before invoking a delegate, instruct it explicitly: report\n   findings, apply nothing, write no ledger, create no files. Several delegates\n   (`improve-system` among them) begin by applying previously approved proposals\n   — that must be suppressed. `aios-audit` writes only its own report and the\n   `Last audited` column.\n2. **Scope must be verified, not assumed.** A delegate's actual coverage is what\n   its body scans, not what this table wishes it scanned. `improve-system` scans\n   `~/SecondBrain/` — Notes, Knowledge, Projects. It does **not** touch\n   `~/.claude/projects/*/memory/` or `global-memory/`. Those are audited by\n   `aios-audit` directly.\n3. **A receipt covers only what was checked.** If a delegate returns findings for\n   a narrower scope than its row claims, write the date **and** a scope note, or\n   leave the row `unknown`. Never stamp a date because a delegate exited cleanly.\n\n## Layout invariants the audit must assert\n\n- `~/.claude/skills/` is canonical, is a git repo, and contains **no symlinks**.\n- `~/.agents/skills/` and `~/.codex/skills/` are **generated views**. Each carries\n  a `.generated-by-sync-to-codex` manifest. Every entry **in the manifest** must be\n  a symlink on Mac (a copy on Windows); wrong representation is drift.\n- Entries **not** in the manifest are third-party installs (`npx skills add`).\n  They are counted and reported, **never** flagged as errors and never pruned.\n- Support directories (`_shared/`) have no SKILL.md and must never be pruned.","originalFile":null,"structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1066,"oldLines":11,"newStart":1066,"newLines":33,"lines":[" Seasonal skills (`forecast-capture`, `ingest-book`) are exempt from low-use"," pressure. Judge them in season."," ","+## Delegation contract (R2-09)","+","+A delegate is invoked **read-only**, for a **named scope**, and its receipt is","+written **only** for the scope it actually covered.","+","+1. **Read-only.** Before invoking a delegate, instruct it explicitly: report","+   findings, apply nothing, write no ledger, create no files. Several delegates","+   (`improve-system` among them) begin by applying previously approved proposals","+   — that must be suppressed. `aios-audit` writes only its own report and the","+   `Last audited` column.","+2. **Scope must be verified, not assumed.** A delegate's actual coverage is what","+   its body scans, not what this table wishes it scanned. `improve-system` scans","+   `~/SecondBrain/` — Notes, Knowledge, Projects. It does **not** touch","+   `~/.claude/projects/*/memory/` or `global-memory/`. Those are audited by","+   `aios-audit` directly.","+3. **A receipt covers only what was checked.** If a delegate returns findings for","+   a narrower scope than its row claims, write the date **and** a scope note, or","+   leave the row `unknown`. Never stamp a date because a delegate exited cleanly.","+"," ## Layout invariants the audit must assert"," "," - `~/.claude/skills/` is canonical, is a git repo, and contains **no symlinks**.","-- `~/.agents/skills/` and `~/.codex/skills/` are **generated views**. A real","-  directory in either means someone edited a view instead of the source.","+- `~/.agents/skills/` and `~/.codex/skills/` are **generated views**. Each carries","+  a `.generated-by-sync-to-codex` manifest. Every entry **in the manifest** must be","+  a symlink on Mac (a copy on Windows); wrong representation is drift.","+- Entries **not** in the manifest are third-party installs (`npx skills add`).","+  They are counted and reported, **never** flagged as errors and never pruned."," - Support directories (`_shared/`) have no SKILL.md and must never be pruned."," "," ## Direction of travel"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"5fe4febb-6dd9-405d-867a-92b0577623a6","session_id":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS","sessionId":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main"}
