{"parentUuid":"66253863-246a-4621-9de2-0d349ef9ac34","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CeywGYe6CR7rqXwoXPZNQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01U1o2EsqyWN9cpp4MN6Vr5E","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-harness-agnostic-aios.md","old_string":"# A stale lock must not wedge the job forever.\nmkdir -p ~/.claude/scripts/.aios-audit.lock\n~/DEV/KeystoneOS/scripts/aios-audit-cron.sh; echo \"exit=$? (expect 0, ABORT logged)\"\nrmdir ~/.claude/scripts/.aios-audit.lock\ntail -6 ~/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/audits/aios-trend.md\n```\n\nExpected: the first prints `exit=1` and adds **no** row; the second prints `exit=0` with `ABORT` in the log and **no** row. If either wrote a row, the failure propagation is not working — fix before loading launchd.","new_string":"# A LIVE lock must make the job stand down.\nL=~/.claude/scripts/.aios-audit.lock\nrm -rf \"$L\"; mkdir -p \"$L\"; echo $$ > \"$L/pid\"     # this shell is alive\n~/DEV/KeystoneOS/scripts/aios-audit-cron.sh; echo \"exit=$? (expect 0, ABORT live run)\"\nrows_before=$(grep -c '^| 20' ~/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/audits/aios-trend.md)\n\n# A STALE lock must be RECLAIMED, not wedge the job forever (R2-06).\nrm -rf \"$L\"; mkdir -p \"$L\"; echo 999999 > \"$L/pid\"  # a pid that cannot exist\n~/DEV/KeystoneOS/scripts/aios-audit-cron.sh; echo \"exit=$? (expect 0, RECLAIM then run)\"\nrows_after=$(grep -c '^| 20' ~/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/audits/aios-trend.md)\necho \"rows before=$rows_before after=$rows_after (expect after = before + 1)\"\nrm -rf \"$L\"\ntail -20 ~/.claude/scripts/logs/aios-audit.log\n```\n\nExpected:\n\n- missing metrics script: `exit=1`, log says `FAIL metrics script errored`, **no** row added\n- live lock: `exit=0`, log says `ABORT live run (pid ...)`, **no** row added\n- stale lock: `exit=0`, log says `RECLAIM stale lock`, **and one row IS added** — `rows_after = rows_before + 1`\n\nThat last line is the whole point of the fix. Round 2 caught that the earlier test removed the lock by hand, which proved nothing about recovery. If a stale lock does not get reclaimed, one crashed run silences the job permanently — fix before loading launchd."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":932,"cache_read_input_tokens":197000,"output_tokens":1070,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":932,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1070,"cache_read_input_tokens":197000,"cache_creation_input_tokens":932,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":932},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CeywGXfHzqv8psSYvJtEB","attributionSkill":"codex-review","type":"assistant","uuid":"7cd2af15-f447-42f8-b00a-d98b375f8c46","timestamp":"2026-09-12T17:26:04.595Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS","sessionId":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main"}
