l you can see. Print only the count and the first ten names.\" 2>&1 | tail -20'"," ```"," "," Expected: a count near 208, not 306. **If it reads ~306, Task 2 did not take — stop and re-run it.** This step is the proof that pruning the pool was the right fix."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"fb483611-d635-4249-a473-936db9b146a5","session_id":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS","sessionId":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main"}
