onical repo","+### PLACEHOLDER-TASK5-MARKER"," ","-**Files:**","-- Modify: `~/.claude/skills/` (19 symlinks become real dirs)","-- Modify: `~/.agents/skills/` (19 real dirs become links back)","-- Create: `~/DEV/KeystoneOS/scripts/skills-canonicalize.sh`","-","-**Interfaces:**","-- Consumes: the hardened sync script from Task 3.","-- Produces: a canonical repo with **zero symlinks**, so Task 5 edits one file per skill and every harness sees it.","-","-**Direction, restated because round 1 had it backwards.** 19 entries in `~/.claude/skills/` are symlinks pointing *out* to `~/.agents/skills/`. Their real content therefore sits outside the git repo — unversioned, not on Windows, not in the backup. This task pulls each real directory **into** the repo and leaves a link behind at the pool.","-"," - [ ] **Step 1: Write the script**"," "," Create `~/DEV/KeystoneOS/scripts/skills-canonicalize.sh`:"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f0d30862-1efa-45fe-8b82-d6ca63c5e08b","session_id":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS","sessionId":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main"}
