{"parentUuid":"b58c9338-5474-414c-ac67-2df790f72392","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CeywoW1CZmqvuRDtb9LAr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Last one — R3-05, the archive verification and phase-aware rollback."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3097,"cache_read_input_tokens":232848,"output_tokens":1359,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3097,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1359,"cache_read_input_tokens":232848,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3097,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3097},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CeywoUxSeuRw7sziDLnjW","attributionSkill":"codex-review","type":"assistant","uuid":"1b8b6e4c-4a50-498f-a1fd-889f874e3b9d","timestamp":"2026-09-12T17:32:54.718Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS","sessionId":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"1b8b6e4c-4a50-498f-a1fd-889f874e3b9d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CeywoW1CZmqvuRDtb9LAr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PjVHAk5fQtHf7x7MbV4inH","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-harness-agnostic-aios.md","old_string":"```bash\nrm -rf /tmp/tartest && mkdir -p /tmp/tartest/{views,canon}\n\ntar xzf ~/.claude/skills-archive/pre-canonical-VIEWS-2026-09-12.tgz -C /tmp/tartest/views\nls /tmp/tartest/views/.agents/skills | wc -l\nls /tmp/tartest/views/.codex/skills | wc -l\necho \"--- views archive must NOT contain .claude (must be empty) ---\"\nls -d /tmp/tartest/views/.claude 2>/dev/null\n\ntar xzf ~/.claude/skills-archive/pre-canonical-CANONICAL-2026-09-12.tgz -C /tmp/tartest/canon\nfind -L /tmp/tartest/canon/.claude/skills -maxdepth 2 -name SKILL.md | wc -l\ntest -f /tmp/tartest/canon/.claude/skills/_shared/config.json && echo \"_shared OK\"\ngit -C /tmp/tartest/canon/.claude/skills log --oneline -1\n```\n\nExpected: `306`, `32`, **no `.claude` directory in the views archive**, then `61`, `_shared OK`, and `3ab4467 chore: apply global skill audit`. If the views archive contains `.claude`, the separation failed — STOP, no later task may run.","new_string":"The two archives must be **separate on disk but extracted into ONE compatible tree** (R3-05). The 19 canonical symlinks are relative (`../../.agents/skills/anti-sleep`), so extracting the canonical archive alone leaves them dangling and the `find -L` count can never reach 61. Extract both into the same scratch root — and never over the live repo:\n\n```bash\nrm -rf /tmp/tartest && mkdir -p /tmp/tartest\n\n# Both archives into ONE scratch root, so the relative links resolve.\ntar xzf ~/.claude/skills-archive/pre-canonical-VIEWS-2026-09-12.tgz     -C /tmp/tartest\ntar xzf ~/.claude/skills-archive/pre-canonical-CANONICAL-2026-09-12.tgz -C /tmp/tartest\n\necho \"--- views ---\"\nls /tmp/tartest/.agents/skills | wc -l\nls /tmp/tartest/.codex/skills  | wc -l\necho \"--- canonical, with links resolving against the extracted pool ---\"\nfind -L /tmp/tartest/.claude/skills -maxdepth 2 -name SKILL.md | wc -l\ntest -f /tmp/tartest/.claude/skills/_shared/config.json && echo \"_shared OK\"\ngit -C /tmp/tartest/.claude/skills log --oneline -1\n\n# Separation check: the VIEWS archive alone must carry no .claude content.\nrm -rf /tmp/viewsonly && mkdir -p /tmp/viewsonly\ntar xzf ~/.claude/skills-archive/pre-canonical-VIEWS-2026-09-12.tgz -C /tmp/viewsonly\necho \"--- must be empty ---\"\nls -d /tmp/viewsonly/.claude 2>/dev/null\n```\n\nExpected: `306`, `32`, `61`, `_shared OK`, `3ab4467 chore: apply global skill audit`, and **no output** from the separation check. If the views archive contains `.claude`, the separation failed — STOP, no later task may run."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3097,"cache_read_input_tokens":232848,"output_tokens":1359,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3097,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1359,"cache_read_input_tokens":232848,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3097,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3097},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CeywoUxSeuRw7sziDLnjW","attributionSkill":"codex-review","type":"assistant","uuid":"4ae50382-6ff9-4daa-bcf0-4f785ddb21ce","timestamp":"2026-09-12T17:33:06.990Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"