te the views:","     bash ~/.claude/skills/sync-to-codex.sh","+","+Expected dev-sync behaviour after OPTION 1: legacy copy-based sync, no manifest,","+no drift metric - `aios-audit` will report `no_manifest`, which is correct and","+expected in that state. After OPTION 2: normal.","+","+Never mix them: hardened script + legacy layout is the one combination that","+leaves dev-sync permanently failing."," EOF"," tail -45 ~/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/audits/2026-09-12-pre-canonical-inventory.txt"," ```"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"cbe7380c-1dea-4a3c-a02d-cdad897f7580","session_id":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS","sessionId":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main"}
