{"parentUuid":"30f21134-5568-4c28-aecc-c2d5892a9a39","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CeyxKULaRYRJPpv1MtcJA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Adding the verification case for the deletion workflow, then updating the audit's expectations."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":449,"cache_read_input_tokens":270374,"output_tokens":1109,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":449,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1109,"cache_read_input_tokens":270374,"cache_creation_input_tokens":449,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":449},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CeyxKTZw4MiMCxTzkeNUK","attributionSkill":"codex-review","type":"assistant","uuid":"ca61f29a-69b3-4457-a546-d42c7360e302","timestamp":"2026-09-12T17:39:41.656Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS","sessionId":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"ca61f29a-69b3-4457-a546-d42c7360e302","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CeyxKULaRYRJPpv1MtcJA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015AxvznjmvrLXNoUKY2L1oA","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-harness-agnostic-aios.md","old_string":"Expected: `FATAL ... is a symlink`, `exit=2`, and the canary file **still readable**. If the canary is gone, the guard does not work — stop and fix before any other task.","new_string":"Expected: `FATAL ... is a symlink`, `exit=2`, and the canary file **still readable**. If the canary is gone, the guard does not work — stop and fix before any other task.\n\n- [ ] **Step 4b: Prove the canonical-deletion workflow leaves no debris (R5-01)**\n\nThis is the normal path after someone deletes a skill and `dev-sync` pulls it. Round 5 caught that the generated link goes dangling, `-e` reads false, and the entry gets silently dropped from the manifest — leaving permanent untracked debris the audit could not see.\n\n```bash\nrm -rf /tmp/delsync && mkdir -p /tmp/delsync/{.claude/skills,.agents/skills,.codex/skills}\nfor s in keeper goner; do\n  mkdir -p /tmp/delsync/.claude/skills/$s\n  printf -- '---\\nname: %s\\ndescription: Use when testing. Do not use otherwise.\\n---\\nbody\\n' \"$s\" \\\n    > /tmp/delsync/.claude/skills/$s/SKILL.md\ndone\n\n# First sync publishes both.\nHOME=/tmp/delsync bash ~/.claude/skills/sync-to-codex.sh >/dev/null\nls -la /tmp/delsync/.agents/skills | grep -c goner\n\n# Simulate the upstream deletion, then sync again.\nrm -rf /tmp/delsync/.claude/skills/goner\nHOME=/tmp/delsync bash ~/.claude/skills/sync-to-codex.sh; echo \"exit=$?\"\n\necho \"--- dangling links left behind (must be 0) ---\"\nfind /tmp/delsync/.agents/skills /tmp/delsync/.codex/skills -maxdepth 1 -type l ! -exec test -e {} \\; -print | wc -l\necho \"--- goner archived, as a link, per view ---\"\nls -la /tmp/delsync/.agents/skills-archive/retired-*/.agents/ 2>/dev/null | grep goner\necho \"--- manifest no longer claims goner ---\"\ngrep -c '^goner$' /tmp/delsync/.agents/skills/.generated-by-sync-to-codex || echo 0\n```\n\nExpected: `1` (published first time); `exit=0`; **`0` dangling links**; `goner` present in the per-view archive; and `0` occurrences in the manifest. A non-zero dangling count means the `-e || -L` fix is not in — stop and fix, because this is the routine deletion path, not an edge case."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":449,"cache_read_input_tokens":270374,"output_tokens":1109,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":449,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1109,"cache_read_input_tokens":270374,"cache_creation_input_tokens":449,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":449},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CeyxKTZw4MiMCxTzkeNUK","attributionSkill":"codex-review","type":"assistant","uuid":"d7583f34-291a-4fb1-9dc9-9c4debf2519f","timestamp":"2026-09-12T17:39:52.122Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS","sessionId":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main"}
