esume ~/.claude/jobs/c59d1788/tmp/codex-review-rN/claudex-*/result.json \\","+    --feedback ~/.claude/jobs/c59d1788/tmp/aios-dispositions-rN.md \\","+    --artifacts ~/.claude/jobs/c59d1788/tmp/codex-review-rN+1","   ```"," ","-  `/tmp/aios-dispositions.md` is written from the disposition table above — R1–R10, accept or reject, and what changed. **No task below runs until this returns APPROVED.** R1 and R3 are data-loss grade.","+  **If this plan is edited before execution, Gate A must be re-run** — an approval binds only the hash it was issued against."," - [ ] **Gate B — after Task 5.** `codex-review` on `sync-to-codex.sh`, `sync-to-codex.ps1`, `skills-canonicalize.sh`, `skill-portability-check.py`, and ten rewritten frontmatter blocks. Codex is the right reviewer here specifically because it is the harness whose triggering the rewrite claims to fix."," - [ ] **Gate C — after Task 7.** `codex-review` on `aios-metrics.py`, `aios-audit-cron.sh`, the plist, and the `aios-audit` SKILL.md body."," - [ ] **Gate D — before declaring done.** `superpowers:verification-before-completion`. Every success claim carries a pasted command output."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"5624b0a5-5cce-4d64-ac60-7dd55f5529d0","session_id":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS","sessionId":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main"}
