{"parentUuid":"69076faa-7bfb-49ca-93bd-609f761e11ca","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"06e7d3ba-222f-4650-8a25-521650a48509","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SsFBWoVRNFVmeoXbkF4c5P","type":"tool_result","content":"118\t`mv ~/.claude/skills-archive/2026-09-12/* ~/.claude/skills/`).\n119\tReport: `~/SecondBrain/Inbox/2026-09-12-skill-audit.md`.\n120\t\n121\tThree traps found while doing it:\n122\t1. **`~/.claude/skills/` is gitignored** inside the `dotclaude` repo — git is NOT a\n123\t   safety net for skills. The archive-move is the only undo.\n124\t2. **45 of the 160 skills are symlinks** into `~/.agents/skills/`. Archiving a symlink\n125\t   de-registers it from Claude Code but leaves the real copy for Codex. Count with\n126\t   `find -L`; plain `find` undercounts by 45.\n127\t3. **\"606 plugin skills\" is cache, not load.** Only 6 of 24 plugins are enabled\n128\t   (~37 skills exposed). The rest are disabled plugins and old cached versions.\n129\t"}]},"uuid":"8a434230-d341-4e17-b549-da2341f24eb9","timestamp":"2026-09-12T17:43:07.556Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/kristinarash/.claude/projects/-Users-kristinarash-DEV/memory/project_skill-bloat-and-promotion.md","content":"`mv ~/.claude/skills-archive/2026-09-12/* ~/.claude/skills/`).\nReport: `~/SecondBrain/Inbox/2026-09-12-skill-audit.md`.\n\nThree traps found while doing it:\n1. **`~/.claude/skills/` is gitignored** inside the `dotclaude` repo — git is NOT a\n   safety net for skills. The archive-move is the only undo.\n2. **45 of the 160 skills are symlinks** into `~/.agents/skills/`. Archiving a symlink\n   de-registers it from Claude Code but leaves the real copy for Codex. Count with\n   `find -L`; plain `find` undercounts by 45.\n3. **\"606 plugin skills\" is cache, not load.** Only 6 of 24 plugins are enabled\n   (~37 skills exposed). The rest are disabled plugins and old cached versions.\n","numLines":12,"startLine":118,"totalLines":129}},