{"parentUuid":"082013ac-5d88-4643-be2a-ed26116b71d6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cez3TyQckQVYS6Woy9f4w","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Qyd4yuQaqM48Z5c6vk6yiM","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-harness-agnostic-aios.md","old_string":"**Now stage, then inspect the index (R2-03).** Round 2 caught the earlier ordering: `git ls-files` reads the *index*, and the index still held the 19 old symlink entries (`anti-sleep`, `claudex-loop`, …) until a `git add` replaced them. Checking before staging proved nothing.\n\n```bash\ncd ~/.claude/skills\ngit add -A","new_string":"**First, untrack the vendored package (AMEND-01).** Four skills — `claudex-loop`, `claudex-route`, `codex-build`, `codex-review` — are one third-party package in `~/.agents/vendor-review/claudex-loop/`, linked into all three trees. They are **already committed to this repo as mode-120000 symlinks and pushed**, which is the exact R3 breakage the plan exists to prevent, already live: Windows pulls four links pointing at a path that does not exist there.\n\nThey are not ours to vendor — same rule as plugin skills. Untrack them and ignore them; the working tree is untouched and they keep working on this Mac.\n\n```bash\ncd ~/.claude/skills\ngit rm --cached claudex-loop claudex-route codex-build codex-review\ncat >> .gitignore <<'EOF'\n\n# Vendored third-party package: ~/.agents/vendor-review/claudex-loop/\n# These four are symlinks into it, linked into .claude/.agents/.codex alike.\n# Committing them published mode-120000 entries that are dead on Windows.\n# Install them per skill `vendored-skill-install`, do not track them here.\n/claudex-loop/\n/claudex-route/\n/codex-build/\n/codex-review/\nEOF\ngit status --short | head\n```\n\nExpected: four `D` (deleted-from-index) lines and a modified `.gitignore`. The four directories must **still exist** on disk — `ls -la ~/.claude/skills/claudex-loop` still shows a link.\n\n**Now stage, then inspect the index (R2-03).** Round 2 caught the earlier ordering: `git ls-files` reads the *index*, and the index still held the old symlink entries until a `git add` replaced them. Checking before staging proved nothing.\n\n```bash\ncd ~/.claude/skills\ngit add -A"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":717,"cache_read_input_tokens":310551,"output_tokens":903,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":717,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":903,"cache_read_input_tokens":310551,"cache_creation_input_tokens":717,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":717},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cez3TxoPiWgBVDWQXFoMp","type":"assistant","uuid":"578d15be-9b48-44ff-9d97-c1732c9141cf","timestamp":"2026-09-12T18:47:19.704Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main"}
