{"parentUuid":"6df7f870-fa60-4f3e-a4e3-66bbf8efeec2","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"output_style","style":"ELI5"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"0c2fb08d-107b-432a-abae-bae673df7442","timestamp":"2026-09-12T18:48:16.807Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nELI5 output style is active. Remember to follow the specific guidelines for this style.\n</system-reminder>"}],"session_id":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"0c2fb08d-107b-432a-abae-bae673df7442","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cez3YygcVS8gsKXcCmXkD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019F8jFAgroWJQsNk8Ky3x9G","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-harness-agnostic-aios.md","old_string":"Expected: `306`, `32`, `61`, `_shared OK`, `3ab4467 chore: apply global skill audit`, and **no output** from the separation check. If the views archive contains `.claude`, the separation failed — STOP, no later task may run.","new_string":"Also assert the vendored package is captured. Four canonical links are a **two-hop chain** — `~/.claude/skills/claudex-loop` → `~/.agents/skills/claudex-loop` → `~/.agents/vendor-review/claudex-loop/skills/claudex-loop`. That vendor directory sits outside `.agents/skills` and the first draft of this step missed it, producing a count of 57:\n\n```bash\ntest -f /tmp/tartest/.agents/vendor-review/claudex-loop/skills/claudex-loop/SKILL.md && echo \"vendor-review OK\"\n```\n\nThe VIEWS tarball must therefore be taken as:\n\n```bash\ntar czf ~/.claude/skills-archive/pre-canonical-VIEWS-2026-09-12.tgz \\\n  -C ~ .codex/skills .agents/skills .agents/vendor-review .agents/.skill-lock.json\n```\n\nExpected: `306`, `32`, `61`, `_shared OK`, `vendor-review OK`, `3ab4467 chore: apply global skill audit`, and **no output** from the separation check. **A count of `57` means `vendor-review` is missing from the tarball** — rebuild it before continuing. If the views archive contains `.claude`, the separation failed — STOP, no later task may run."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":453,"cache_read_input_tokens":319127,"output_tokens":686,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search