{"parentUuid":"e2f587d7-e6a9-45b8-9423-fe06bfea60e0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cez3bHUzLVP3sRsYZ5X1P","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Kbkrbw32ePA8EWjaADqvPy","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS\n# verify embedded scripts still parse after the amendments\npython3 - <<'PY'\nimport re,subprocess\nt=open(\"docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-harness-agnostic-aios.md\",encoding=\"utf-8\").read()\nok=True\nfor i,b in enumerate(re.findall(r\"```python\\n(.*?)```\",t,re.S)):\n    try: compile(b,f\"py{i}\",\"exec\")\n    except SyntaxError as e: ok=False; print(\"PY ERROR\",e)\nfor i,b in enumerate(re.findall(r\"```bash\\n(.*?)```\",t,re.S)):\n    if not b.lstrip().startswith(\"#!\"): continue\n    r=subprocess.run([\"bash\",\"-n\"],input=b,text=True,capture_output=True)\n    if r.returncode: ok=False; print(\"BASH ERROR\",r.stderr[:150])\nprint(\"embedded scripts:\",\"all parse\" if ok else \"FAILURES\")\nPY\ngit add -A docs/\ngit commit -q -m \"Task 1 complete: snapshot + AMEND-01 (two-hop vendored chain)\n\nVerifying the snapshot found four canonical entries are a two-hop symlink\nchain into ~/.agents/vendor-review/claudex-loop/, which was outside the\nVIEWS tarball - the canonical count restored as 57, not 61. Tarball now\nincludes vendor-review.\n\nThose four are also ALREADY committed to erash11/claude-skills as\nmode-120000 symlinks and pushed, i.e. the R3 breakage the plan exists to\nprevent, already live and dead on Windows. Plan amended in 6 places to\nuntrack + gitignore them rather than vendor them into the repo, matching\nthe existing rule for plugin skills.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\"\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Task 1 Step 5 — verify and commit"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"ca