{"parentUuid":"382f3ef4-ff00-4913-9c23-801ea1f55ab8","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"d90457fc-55a4-4c91-beb9-bfaecc9c0aa3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NSy1AHfAQnUgj62XEjxoez","type":"tool_result","content":"   5d3f91a..9619109  main -> main\n9619109 fix: R8-01..R8-11, ownership is structural, inversion script deleted\n5d3f91a docs: STATUS reflects AIOS Tasks 1-2 complete, Task 3 next\nbb3fd3a Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main'\nc175c54 docs: fill STATUS.md from git history (dev-sync, Windows)","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"4e2030d7-f143-471b-b4d4-161d8e16ad11","timestamp":"2026-09-12T19:32:04.248Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"   5d3f91a..9619109  main -> main\n9619109 fix: R8-01..R8-11, ownership is structural, inversion script deleted\n5d3f91a docs: STATUS reflects AIOS Tasks 1-2 complete, Task 3 next\nbb3fd3a Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main'\nc175c54 docs: fill STATUS.md from git history (dev-sync, Windows)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"gitOperation":{"push":{"branch":"main"}},"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/STATUS.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":2,"oldLines":14,"newStart":2,"newLines":54,"lines":[" "," Read this first. Update it before ending every session."," ","-## Done","-- Repository brought under git and pushed to erash11 during the 2026-09-09 DEV + GitHub migration.","+<!-- Filled 2026-09-12 by dev-sync on Windows, reconstructed from git history and the","+     AIOS plan. It was an empty migration stub before this. Verify before relying on it. -->","+","+## Current state","+- The dominant thread is the **harness-agnostic AIOS plan**:","+  `docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-harness-agnostic-aios.md`. Goal is that every skill","+  Eric owns loads identically in Claude Code, Codex and Pi from one versioned canonical","+  folder, plus a recurring audit that keeps the AIOS from rotting.","+- Architecture: `~/.claude/skills/` (repo `erash11/claude-skills`) is canonical and holds","+  real directories only. `~/.agents/skills/` and `~/.codex/skills/` are generated views","+  rebuilt per machine by `sync-to-codex.sh` / `.ps1` - symlinks on Mac, copies on Windows.","+- Codex approved the plan on round 6 (findings 10 -> 9 -> 7 -> 4 -> 1 -> 0), then a","+  round-7 pass (R7-01..R7-05) folded in one declared vendor inventory everywhere.","+- **2026-09-12 afternoon, Mac: Task 1 (snapshot and freeze, plus AMEND-01) and Task 2","+  (prune the stale pool mirror, 306 -> 208) are complete.** Task 2 archived 98 skills","+  that were still live in `~/.agents/skills`. Reversible. Audit records are in","+  `docs/audits/2026-09-12-*.txt`.","+- The approval was a static, read-only review. It is an approved plan, not proven","+  behaviour. Gates B, C and D still apply.","+- Also landed recently: daily-backup schedule aligned with launchd (00:30 -> 09:00), a","+  stale Windows duplicate of `reMarkale_extract` dropped, and a corrupt","+  `memsearch-sync.ps1.from-mac` removed."," "," ## Next","--","+- **Task 3: harden the sync writers before anything moves** (`sync-to-codex.sh` and the","+  `.ps1` twin). Then Task 4 (invert the outward symlinks, publish the views) and Task 5","+  (portable frontmatter).","+- Gate B is a `codex-review` after Task 5. Gate C comes after Task 7, Gate D before","+  declaring done.","+- Plan checkboxes are not being ticked (Task 1 still shows unchecked). Commit messages","+  are the reliable progress record."," "," ## Open questions","--","+- None recorded in the plan. Round 6 closed with no material unresolved defects in scope."," "," ## Gotchas","--","+- Never commit a symlink into `~/.claude/skills/`. Windows pulls that repo and an absolute","+  Mac symlink arrives unusable.","+- Hooks and sync scripts exist in two copies (`~/.claude/hooks/`, `~/.codex/hooks/`; `.sh`","+  and `.ps1`). Any change patches both.","+- Global `MEMORY.md` is at 2,489 of 2,500 chars. Consolidate before adding to it.","+- Never point Pi at `~/DEV` - it ships no sandbox and no approval prompts, by design.","+- Never let any harness near `DexaProject` (identifiable athlete health data, on Google","+  Drive, not in `~/DEV`).","+- Plugin skills (`superpowers`, `mattpocock-skills`) are vendored and out of scope.","+- **Windows:** four vendored skills (`claudex-loop`, `claudex-route`, `codex-build`,","+  `codex-review`) are committed to `claude-skills` as symlinks. On Windows they arrive","+  pointing at a path that does not exist. AMEND-01 in Task 4 untracks them.","+- On the Mac: `timeout` is not installed, `dcg` blocks `find ... -delete`, and Python is","+  PEP 668-managed (stdlib `python3` or `uv`, never global `pip install`).","+- No success claim without pasted command output."]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/STATUS.md"]}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"382f3ef4-ff00-4913-9c23-801ea1f55ab8","session_id":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS","sessionId":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"4e2030d7-f143-471b-b4d4-161d8e16ad11","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cez6qVrcwkRdeD8TEUJAV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01XRFWso5TCgHAoyCRADTNXn","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"echo \"=== git version (need >= 2.26 for --pathspec-from-file) ===\"\ngit --version\necho\necho \"=== R9-01 premise: are the drifted pool copies still intact real dirs? ===\"\nfor s in memory-write meeting-sync; do\n  p=/Users/kristinarash/.agents/skills/$s\n  if [ -L \"$p\" ]; then echo \"$s: LINK (edits may already be lost)\"\n  elif [ -d \"$p\" ]; then\n    if diff -rq \"/Users/kristinarash/.claude/skills/$s\" \"$p\" >/dev/null 2>&1; then echo \"$s: real dir, identical to canonical\"\n    else echo \"$s: real dir, STILL DIVERGED - unique edits intact\"; fi\n  else echo \"$s: ABSENT\"; fi\ndone\necho\necho \"=== skills repo hooks and exclude file ===\"\nls -la /Users/kristinarash/.claude/skills/.git/hooks/ | grep -v '\\.sample$'\necho \"--- pre-commit present? ---\"\ntest -e /Users/kristinarash/.claude/skills/.git/hooks/pre-commit && cat /Users/kristinarash/.claude/skills/.git/hooks/pre-commit || echo \"no pre-commit hook\"\necho \"--- core.hooksPath set? ---\"\ngit -C /Users/kristinarash/.claude/skills config --get core.hooksPath || echo \"core.hooksPath not set (default .git/hooks)\"\necho \"--- .git/info/exclude ---\"\ncat /Users/kristinarash/.claude/skills/.git/info/exclude 2>/dev/null || echo \"(no exclude file)\"\necho\necho \"=== does anything besides dev-sync call sync-to-codex? ===\"\ngrep -rl 'sync-to-codex' /Users/kristinarash/.claude/scripts /Users/kristinarash/.claude/hooks /Users/kristinarash/Library/LaunchAgents 2>/dev/null || echo \"nothing in scripts/hooks/launchagents\"","description":"Check disk state, git version, and hook setup"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,