{"parentUuid":"1d4ad3d4-e421-43bd-aa85-5f38299b188c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CezKkeLiwPM2QG8xCdihx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019Z8K4gz6LyMfmYVPaeGesK","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS\ngit add docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-12-harness-agnostic-aios.md\ngit commit -q -m \"fix: R12-01, refuse any DRY_RUN value other than 0 or 1\n\nClaude review round 12 APPROVED with one low finding, fixed because it is a\ndata-loss route: the bash sync tested DRY against \\\"0\\\" in five places and\n\\\"1\\\" in two, so DRY_RUN=true skipped the first-run gate yet still ran the\npublish loop's rm -rf. DRY is now validated once, before the gate.\n\nVerified: true/yes/2 refuse with exit 2 and leave the drifted pool copy\nintact; 1 stays a dry run; 0 still publishes on a prepared machine.\nControl run of the pre-fix script (5779c56) with DRY_RUN=true exited 0,\nprinted no gate message and replaced the pool copy with a link.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\"\ngit log --oneline -1\ngit pull --rebase -q origin main && git push 2>&1 | tail -1","description":"Commit and push the round-12 fix"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4950,"cache_read_input_tokens":591439,"output_tokens":1873,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":508},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4950,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":32,"output_tokens":1873,"cache_read_input_tokens":591439,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4950,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4950},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transfor