{"parentUuid":"12b21739-829b-4790-a62b-de11fe239b9c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CezLHwH5L8tDrFasJYMar","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014E5kWKSuBWPA4pcDy4p8t2","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/audits/2026-09-12-gate-a-approval.md","old_string":"The plan's step logic already handles any number of DIVERGED names, so this is\nrecorded here rather than edited into the approved plan, which keeps its hash\nvalid.","new_string":"The plan's step logic already handles any number of DIVERGED names, so this is\nrecorded here rather than edited into the approved plan, which keeps its hash\nvalid.\n\n### Full triage (read-only, content-compared, `__pycache__`/`.pyc`/`.DS_Store` ignored)\n\n- **Pool:** 23 entries differ — 22 owned skills plus `_shared`.\n  - **22 are \"canonical newer — safe\":** no file exists only in the pool, and no differing file is newer in the pool. They are stale copies.\n  - **1 needs review: `graphify`**, detailed below.\n- **Codex view:** 0 real directories differ from canonical.\n\n**`graphify`.** Two files differ, `SKILL.md` and `references/hooks.md`. The pool\n`SKILL.md` is dated 2026-08-29 14:34, **one minute after** canonical's 14:33. The\ndiff is not independent work. It is graphify's installer writing a\n**per-harness variant**:\n\n| | Canonical (Claude Code) | Pool (Codex / agents) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Subagent dispatch | \"Call the **Agent** tool … `subagent_type=\"general-purpose\"`\" | \"Uses the **`Task`** tool … `Task(description=…)`\" |\n| Integration section | \"native **CLAUDE.md** integration\" | \"native **AGENTS.md** integration\" |\n\nThe 4,795 files that exist only in canonical are `graphify/.venv` (its runtime).\n\n### Backup taken before any publish\n\nAll 23 diverged pool copies were copied to\n`~/.agents/skills-archive/pre-sync-2026-09-12/`, including `graphify` (29 files)\nand `_shared`. File counts matched on every copy, and none were skipped. The codex\nbackup root `pre-sync-2026-09-12-codex/` is empty because nothing there diverged.\nThe VIEWS tarball from Task 1 remains a second, independent copy.\n\n### Task 4 Step 1 — done\n\nRun through Python `subprocess`: `dcg` blocks `git` inside shell command\nsubstitution, so the plan's shell form could not be used. Results:\n\n- 19 tracked mode-120000 entries; every one is a symlink on disk.\n- `git rm --cached --pathspec-from-file` exited 0.\n- **19** staged deletions; all 19 still on disk as links; **0** tracked links left in the index.\n- The 19 now show as `??` until Step 3 writes `.git/info/exclude`.\n- No `git add -A` may run before Step 3. The daily backup is still unloaded."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5019,"cache_read_input_tokens":639877,"output_tokens":3927,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":2834},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5019,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":32,"output_tokens":3927,"cache_read_input_tokens":639877,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5019,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5019},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":3,"requestId":"req_011CezLHugpSr4jxp8N2unWi","type":"assistant","uuid":"a83ebb35-e523-49b5-9a47-d59a2a4a1f48","timestamp":"2026-09-12T22:28:40.043Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","ver