Claude copy is current. Update both: `--platform claude` **and** `--platform agents`.\n(Two more stamps exist under `~/.codex-migration-backups/` — those are backups, leave them.)\n\n**The old manifest was Windows-era.** A `--update` in `~/SecondBrain/Inbox/meetings` reported\nall 264 files as new because the June manifest held `graphify-out\\GRAPH_REPORT.md`\n(backslash). After a path migration, `--update` is not incremental — plan a full rebuild.\n\n**Two traps when rebuilding a folder that already has a graph:**\n1. Move the old `graphify-out` **outside** the corpus before re-detecting. Left as a sibling\n   backup inside the folder it inflated the corpus from 265 to 327 files (its cache JSON got\n   scanned as code).\n2. The semantic cache keys on file paths, so a path change makes it a 0% hit — budget for\n   full re-extraction, not a cheap top-up.\n\n**Extraction agents can die mid-write.** A session rate limit killed 3 of 12 agents and left\none chunk's JSON truncated. Do not re-run blindly — a truncated chunk is usually salvageable\nby `raw_decode`-ing each complete object out of the `nodes`/`edges` arrays and dropping the\npartial tail. That recovered all 22 files of the dead chunk with nothing lost.\n\nRelated: [[dev-layout-and-discovery]]","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"4b9dd88d-c6c0-4049-9496-0ebb1ea60327","session_id":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"929bc9f9-38e9-4fa6-9769-88c4662404bb","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CezLMmZY7au2TQrE6L9zS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01URR7E7PJuUPm9VYBrEmh9F","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport os\nH=\"/Users/kristinarash\"; C=f\"{H}/.claude/skills\"; X=f\"{H}/.codex/skills\"; P=f\"{H}/.agents/skills\"\nowned={n for n in os.listdir(C) if not n.startswith(\".\") and not os.path.islink(f\"{C}/{n}\") and os.path.isdir(f\"{C}/{n}\") and (os.path.isfile(f\"{C}/{n}/SKILL.md\") or n==\"_shared\")}\nthird={n for n in os.listdir(C) if os.path.islink(f\"{C}/{n}\")}\ndef classify(view):\n    rows={\"owned-realdir\":[], \"owned-link\":[], \"third-party\":[], \"unmanaged-realdir\":[], \"unmanaged-link\":[], \"other\":[]}\n    for n in sorted(os.listdir(view)):\n        if n.startswith(\".\"): continue\n        p=f\"{view}/{n}\"; link=os.path.islink(p)\n        if n in owned: rows[\"owned-link\" if link else \"owned-realdir\"].append((n, os.readlink(p) if link else \"\"))\n        elif n in third: rows[\"third-party\"].append((n, os.readlink(p) if link else \"REALDIR\"))\n        elif link: rows[\"unmanaged-link\"].append((n, os.readlink(p)))\n        elif os.path.isdir(p): rows[\"unmanaged-realdir\"].append((n,\"\"))\n        else: rows[\"other\"].append((n,\"\"))\n    return rows\nprint(f\"canonical: owned(published)={len(owned)}  third-party links={len(third)}\")\nfor label, view in ((\"CODEX view\", X), (\"POOL view\", P)):\n    r=classify(view)\n    print(f\"\\n=== {label} ===\")\n    for k,v in r.items():\n        print(f\"  {k:<18} {len(v)}\")\n    if label==\"CODEX view\":\n        for k in (\"owned-realdir\",\"owned-link\",\"third-party\",\"unmanaged-realdir\"):\n            for n,t in r[k]: print(f\"    {k:<18} {n:<28} {t}\")\n    else:\n        print(\"    owned-realdir (will become links):\", len(r['owned-realdir']))\n        print(\"    owned names MISSING from pool (will be created):\", sorted(owned - set(os.listdir(P))))\nPY","description":"Map codex and pool views before the real publish"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":34,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5528,"cache_read_input_tokens":1293824,"output_tokens":2894,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1504},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4032,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":32,"output_tokens":215,"cache_read_input_tokens":644896,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4032,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4032},"type":"message"},{"input_tokens":518371,"output_tokens":7684,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"advisor_message","model":"claude-fable-5-1"},{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2679,"cache_read_input_tokens":648928,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1496,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1496,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":7,"requestId":"req_011CezLMjjtq6eAttEgytVox","type":"assistant","uuid":"f75a87b1-d0b5-46df-be6a-3fb03a6dec78","timestamp":"2026-09-12T22:31:06.004Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main"}
