{"parentUuid":"4b5adb9b-9ab1-4883-a74e-6f6bed4569a7","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"skill_listing","content":"- library-advisor: Consult a grounded domain advisor built from your curated book library. Answers ONLY from ingested library entries, cites every claim, and explicitly separates grounded knowledge from general knowledge. Use when the user says \"ask my <domain> advisor\", \"/library-advisor <domain> <question>\", \"what would my library say about…\", \"consult my library advisor\", or consults a standing advisor. Domains live in SecondBrain/Knowledge/library/advisors/. NOT FOR the built-in /advisor reviewer command, which is a different tool. Do not use to review a domain for gaps, contested entries, or missing coverage, or when the user says \"review my library\" or \"what's missing from my <domain> advisor\" (use library-review).","skillCount":1,"isInitial":false,"names":["library-advisor"]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"0ff959ec-12f2-46a1-9312-b325876b356d","timestamp":"2026-09-12T22:42:37.656Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nThe following skills are available for use with the Skill tool:\n\n- library-advisor: Consult a grounded domain advisor built from your curated book library. Answers ONLY from ingested library entries, cites every claim, and explicitly separates grounded knowledge from general knowledge. Use when the user says \"ask my <domain> advisor\", \"/library-advisor <domain> <question>\", \"what would my library say about…\", \"consult my library advisor\", or consults a standing advisor. Domains live in SecondBrain/Knowledge/library/advisors/. NOT FOR the built-in /advisor reviewer command, which is a different tool. Do not use to review a domain for gaps, contested entries, or missing coverage, or when the user says \"review my library\" or \"what's missing from my <domain> advisor\" (use library-review).\n</system-reminder>"}],"session_id":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external"