{"parentUuid":"7a6e4c60-6d77-4e82-aff7-0b50ef7d120b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CezMcThmcUAp2f8cH1boY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":453,"cache_read_input_tokens":219483,"output_tokens":1642,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":350},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":453,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":32,"output_tokens":1642,"cache_read_input_tokens":219483,"cache_creation_input_tokens":453,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":453},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CezMcT3qKpQpbztHCVyKL","type":"assistant","uuid":"e44a3c85-d316-4e3b-aaa5-c2059ba5c301","timestamp":"2026-09-12T22:45:13.194Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main","slug":"replicated-greeting-planet"}
{"parentUuid":"e44a3c85-d316-4e3b-aaa5-c2059ba5c301","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CezMcThmcUAp2f8cH1boY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014La4XSih5LY6XxV3cXA9S4","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/audits/2026-09-12-gate-a-approval.md","old_string":"Committed `5f80203` (erash11/claude-skills) and pushed; HEAD == upstream; tree clean. The pre-commit hook allowed the deletions. |","new_string":"Committed `5f80203` (erash11/claude-skills) and pushed; HEAD == upstream; tree clean. The pre-commit hook allowed the deletions. |\n\n## Task 5 — evidence\n\n| Step | Evidence |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Checker extracted byte-for-byte from plan lines 1583–1732 (150 lines); compiles; `chmod +x`. |\n| 2 | Baseline `checked 42 skills, 33 failing, 9 portable`, exit 1. Empty inventory: `FATAL no SKILL.md found`, exit 2. Bad fixtures: all four FAIL for the stated reason (negonly: no standalone positive; dupekey: duplicate key; badquote: unbalanced quote; fragments: both clauses missing), exit 1. `dcg` blocks `rm -rf` inside a heredoc, so fixtures were built in fresh folders under the job tmp dir instead. |\n| 3 | 33 descriptions rewritten from a hand-written file, in plan priority order, five per batch, checker after each batch (every batch: 0 still failing). Only the description block changed (plus `Harvest` `name:` → `Harvest`). Word-diff vs HEAD: only connector words removed (`Triggers on`, `Trigger phrases`, `whenever`, `instead.`, `automatically`). A real YAML loader (`uv run --with pyyaml`) parses all 42; **`new-project` was invalid YAML before** (unquoted `: `). Bodies byte-identical to HEAD: a first pass normalised CRLF in `html-to-pdf` and `pp-espn`; reverted to the original bytes. `library-advisor` got one extra `Do not use` sentence. |\n| 4 | `checked 42 skills, 0 failing, 42 portable`, exit 0. |\n| 5 | Headless runs, not interactive sessions (background job). `claude -p` with Bash/Write/Edit denied and a 3-turn cap; `codex exec -s read-only`. `memory-write`, `pp-zotero-research-library`, `meeting-prep`: loaded in **both** harnesses. `library-review`: loaded in Codex; **not listed in Claude Code at all**. |\n\n**Finding from Step 5, verified:** `~/.claude/settings.json` `skillOverrides`\nsets 12 canonical skills `\"off\"`: 7 owned (`ArXiv`, `ISA`, `Science`,\n`capture-insight`, `library-review`, `pp-espn`, `session-miner`) and 5\nthird-party (`grilling`, `handoff`, `prototype`, `teach`, `watch`). Claude Code\nomits them from its skill list. Codex does not read that file, so it loads\nthem. This predates Task 5 (three of the seven were never edited). Two\nconsequences:\n\n- Harness parity is broken by config, not by frontmatter. This is an `aios-audit` finding.\n- Task 4 Step 7's \"`/skills` shows 61\" can never hold: Claude Code exposes 49 of the 61 (35 of 42 owned). The count was already this before the migration.\n\nA side-effect check after the `memory-write` runs found no memory file written\nin either harness."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":453,"cache_read_input_tokens":219483,"output_tokens":1642,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":350},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":453,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":32,"output_tokens":1642,"cache_read_input_tokens":219483,"cache_creation_input_tokens":453,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":453},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CezMcT3qKpQpbztHCVyKL","type":"assistant","uuid":"fb76afb7-67c5-