 Check 3 (freshness). |\n| Vault | `~/SecondBrain/` | medium | 1 month | unknown | brain-audit | Delegate to `brain-audit` (four C's score). |\n| Context posture | workspace-wide | medium | 3 months | unknown | doctor-plus | Delegate to `doctor-plus`. |\n\n## The question that governs a skill's fate\n\nNot \"how often did I run it?\" but **\"would the current model do this fine\nwithout the skill?\"** If yes, the skill is a crutch that now limits the model.\nDelete it. Keep only skills carrying tacit knowledge the model cannot know:\nforce-plate thresholds, GPS conventions, Baylor reporting norms, Eric's own\nroutines.\n\n--- unknown count ---\n12","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"006e116d-0f54-4284-a657-93ed7b9b1ad8","timestamp":"2026-09-12T22:46:10.262Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"wrote /Users/kristinarash/.claude/rot.md\n# rot.md — how fast each AIOS layer goes stale\n\nAudit each layer on its own clock, not all at once. `aios-audit` reads this\nfile: any layer past due, or marked `unknown`, is a finding.\n\n**A date here is a receipt, not an intention.** Write one only after that\nlayer's check in the last column has actually run and produced output.\n\n| Layer | Where it lives | Rots | Audit every | Last audited | Owner | Concrete check |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Identity | `global-memory/USER.md` | very slow | 3 months | unknown | memory-write | Read USER.md; flag any role, family, or career fact c\n| Substrate | `~/.claude/CLAUDE.md`, `AGENTS.md`, `~/DEV/*.md` routers | slow | 3 months | unknown | os-audit | Delegate to `os-audit` Check\n| Skills | `~/.claude/skills/` | fast | 1 month | 2026-09-12 | aios-audit | `skill-portability-check.py` + never-used list + the crutch test\n| Agents | `~/.claude/agents/` | fast | 1 month | unknown | aios-audit | Count `*.md`. Currently **0 exist** — report \"no agents defined\" an\n| Rules | `~/.claude/CLAUDE.md` behaviour rules, output styles | fastest | 1 week | unknown | aios-audit | Diff CLAUDE.md against the last 