ides` parity gap not enforced) |","+","+All accepted. Fixed in `8c6bb7a` (claude-skills) and `e47e3af` (KeystoneOS):","+","+- **R13-01:** both twins resolve all three roots through every link in the path and its ancestors and refuse (exit 2, no changes) on same-or-nested roots. Bash: 9 scratch-HOME cases pass, canonical intact in all. PowerShell: parses; resolver tested on real symlinks under pwsh 7 (7 cases pass); Windows PowerShell 5.1 not exercised.","+- **R13-02:** `name: harvest` restored; local folder case fixed; real sync retired the `Harvest` view links (archived) and published `harvest`. Metrics after: drift 0/0, dangling 0/0, tracked links 0.","+- **R13-03 / B-01:** plain scalars with `: ` or ` #` fail. 6 new fixtures behave as expected; PyYAML cross-check over 48 files: 0 disagreements.","+- **B-02, in part:** owned skills `\"off\"` in Claude Code but published now fail the checker — **7 today**. Choosing the enabled roster is left to Eric (the overrides were set on purpose in the 2026-09-12 skill audit).","+- Not a finding: three descriptions trimmed under 650 chars.","+","+Consequence for the numbers: `portability_failures` is now **7**, not 0, until the roster decision is made."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3b8267b5-e784-458b-839d-2339cec6a302","session_id":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS","sessionId":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main","slug":"replicated-greeting-planet"}
