{"parentUuid":"85d70897-c13d-4004-ba81-fc43cf280eec","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CezPZ3V9TPpEGq7aAewRw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01AEm39A5HxF6qGFDeuDM3kb","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS\npython3 scripts/aios-metrics.py > /Users/kristinarash/.claude/jobs/c59d1788/tmp/t6-metrics-final.txt 2>&1; echo \"metrics exit=$?\"\ncat /Users/kristinarash/.claude/jobs/c59d1788/tmp/t6-metrics-final.txt\ngrep -c -v '^[a-z_]*=' /Users/kristinarash/.claude/jobs/c59d1788/tmp/t6-metrics-final.txt | sed 's/^/non key=value lines: /'\ncp /Users/kristinarash/.claude/rot.md docs/rot.md\ngit add .claude/skills/aios-audit/SKILL.md .claude/skills/os-audit/SKILL.md scripts/aios-metrics.py docs/rot.md docs/audits/2026-09-12-gate-a-approval.md\ngit status --short\ngit commit -q -m \"feat: aios-audit compound skill + rot.md decay tiers\n\nProject-level aios-audit owns the harness layer (skills, agents, hooks, rules,\nagent memory, cross-harness parity) and delegates the other five audits\nread-only. aios-metrics.py prints the machine-readable invariants; it honours\nthe portability checker's exit code (Gate B r2 K2-03). Also records Gate B\nround 2 in the execution log.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NJF6qVz7V5DeaWmDJ72aRK\"\necho \"commit exit=$?\"; git log --oneline -1\ngit push -q 2>&1 | tail -2; git rev-parse HEAD @{u}; echo \"status lines: $(git status --porcelain | wc -l)\"","description":"Run Task 6 metrics check, then commit Task 6"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1881,"cache_read_input_tokens":441510,"output_tokens":1930,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":677},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},