{"parentUuid":"837250b6-ec61-4de7-b468-4703cd9418b1","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b5056620-885f-4cb3-99cc-a7cb889b9006","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AEm39A5HxF6qGFDeuDM3kb","type":"tool_result","content":"metrics exit=0\ndate=2026-09-12\ncanonical_skills=42\nthird_party_links_in_canonical=19\npool_entries=213\npool_skills=210\ncodex_skills=52\nproject_skills=2\ntracked_symlinks_in_canonical=0\npool_view_drift=0\ncodex_view_drift=0\npool_third_party=168\ncodex_third_party=10\npool_dangling=0\ncodex_dangling=0\nagents=0\nhooks_claude=61\nhooks_codex=59\nsessions=407\nskills_ever_used=58\nskills_used_3plus=30\nskills_used_once=19\nnever_used=20\nroster_tokens_est=6671\nportability_failures=7\nnon key=value lines: 1\nA  .claude/skills/aios-audit/SKILL.md\nM  .claude/skills/os-audit/SKILL.md\nM  docs/audits/2026-09-12-gate-a-approval.md\nA  docs/rot.md\nA  scripts/aios-metrics.py\ncommit exit=0\n8773ff2 feat: aios-audit compound skill + rot.md decay tiers\n8773ff260a79ebb313abe6b7c1a6292e35d5f88c\n8773ff260a79ebb313abe6b7c1a6292e35d5f88c\nstatus lines:        0","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"f9a3e09c-7487-442c-8a62-75a56183f1e0","timestamp":"2026-09-12T23:10:56.849Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"metrics exit=0\ndate=2026-09-12\ncanonical_skills=42\nthird_party_links_in_canonical=19\npool_entries=213\npool_skills=210\ncodex_skills=52\nproject_skills=2\ntracked_symlinks_in_canonical=0\npool_view_drift=0\ncodex_view_drift=0\npool_third_party=168\ncodex_third_party=10\npool_dangling=0\ncodex_dangling=0\nagents=0\nhooks_claude=61\nhooks_codex=59\nsessions=407\nskills_ever_used=58\nskills_used_3plus=30\nskills_used_once=19\nnever_used=20\nroster_tokens_est=6671\nportability_failures=7\nnon key=value lines: 1\nA  .claude/skills/aios-audit/SKILL.md\nM  .claude/skills/os-audit/SKILL.md\nM  docs/audits/2026-09-12-gate-a-approval.md\nA  docs/rot.md\nA  scripts/aios-metrics.py\ncommit exit=0\n8773ff2 feat: aios-audit compound skill + rot.md decay tiers\n8773ff260a79ebb313abe6b7c1a6292e35d5f88c\n8773ff260a79ebb313abe6b7c1a6292e35d5f88c\nstatus lines:        0","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/rot.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":0,"oldLines":0,"newStart":1,"newLines":69,"lines":["+# rot.md — how fast each AIOS layer goes stale","+","+Audit each layer on its own clock, not all at once. `aios-audit` reads this","+file: any layer past due, or marked `unknown`, is a finding.","+","+**A date here is a receipt, not an intention.** Write one only after that","+layer's check in the last column has actually run and produced output.","+","+| Layer | Where it lives | Rots | Audit every | Last audited | Owner | Concrete check |","+|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|","+| Identity | `global-memory/USER.md` | very slow | 3 months | unknown | memory-write | Read USER.md; flag any role, family, or career fact contradicted by the last 90 days of sessions. |","+| Substrate | `~/.claude/CLAUDE.md`, `AGENTS.md`, `~/DEV/*.md` routers | slow | 3 months | unknown | os-audit | Delegate to `os-audit` Check 1 (routing integrity). |","+| Skills | `~/.claude/skills/` | fast | 1 month | 2026-09-12 | aios-audit | `skill-portability-check.py` + never-used list + the crutch test below. |","+| Agents | `~/.claude/agents/` | fast | 1 month | unknown | aios-audit | Count `*.md`. Currently **0 exist** — report \"no agents defined\" and skip until one does. |","+| Rules | `~/.claude/CLAUDE.md` behaviour rules, output styles | fastest | 1 week | unknown | aios-audit | Diff CLAUDE.md against the last 7 days of sessions: any rule contradicted by what actually happened, and any correction the user repeated twice that is not yet a rule. |","+| Hooks | `~/.claude/hooks/`, `~/.codex/hooks/` | slow | 6 months | unknown | claude-stack-doctor | Delegate. Also diff the two copies — they must match (`hook-two-copies-trap`). |","+| Memory (agent) | `~/.claude/projects/*/memory/`, `global-memory/` | medium | 1 month | unknown | **aios-audit itself** | Audited directly — see the delegation contract below. `improve-system` does NOT cover these stores. Check: every `MEMORY.md` index line resolves to a file; every memory file appears in its index; `global-memory/MEMORY.md` is under its 2,500-char cap; flag time-dimensioned facts (counters, \"still open\", past-tense futures). |","+| Memory (vault notes) | `~/SecondBrain/` notes | medium | 1 month | unknown | improve-system | Delegate — but read-only, per the contract below. |","+| Data feeds | Fireflies, GPS, CFBD, Zotero | varies | 1 week | unknown | os-audit | Delegate to `os-audit` Check 3 (freshness). |","+| Vault | `~/SecondBrain/` | medium | 1 month | unknown | brain-audit | Delegate to `brain-audit` (four C's score). |","+| Context posture | workspace-wide | medium | 3 months | unknown | doctor-plus | Delegate to `doctor-plus`. |","+","+## The question that governs a skill's fate","+","+Not \"how often did I run it?\" but **\"would the current model do this fine","+without the skill?\"** If yes, the skill is a crutch that now limits the model.","+Delete it. Keep only skills carrying tacit knowledge the model cannot know:","+force-plate thresholds, GPS conventions, Baylor reporting norms, Eric's own","+routines.","+","+Seasonal skills (`forecast-capture`, `ingest-book`) are exempt from low-use","+pressure. Judge them in season.","+","+## Delegation contract (R2-09)","+","+A delegate is invoked **read-only**, for a **named scope**, and its receipt is","+written **only** for the scope it actually covered.","+","+1. **Read-only.** Before invoking a delegate, instruct it explicitly: report","+   findings, apply nothing, write no ledger, create no files. Several delegates","+   (`improve-system` among them) begin by applying previously approved proposals","+   — that must be suppressed. `aios-audit` writes only its own report and the","+   `Last audited` column.","+2. **Scope must be verified, not assumed.** A delegate's actual coverage is what","+   its body scans, not what this table wishes it scanned. `improve-system` scans","+   `~/SecondBrain/` — Notes, Knowledge, Projects. It does **not** touch","+   `~/.claude/projects/*/memory/` or `global-memory/`. Those are audited by","+   `aios-audit` directly.","+3. **A receipt covers only what was checked.** If a delegate returns findings for","+   a narrower scope than its row claims, write the date **and** a scope note, or","+   leave the row `unknown`. Never stamp a date because a delegate exited cleanly.","+","+## Layout invariants the audit must assert","+","+- `~/.claude/skills/` is canonical, is a git repo, and contains **no TRACKED symlinks**","+  (`git ls-files -s` shows no mode 120000). On-disk links to third-party skills are","+  expected; they are listed in the per-machine `.git/info/exclude` (never the tracked","+  `.gitignore`), and a pre-commit hook refuses to commit one. What must never happen is","+  committing a link, because Windows pulls this repo and a Mac link is dead there.","+- `~/.agents/skills/` and `~/.codex/skills/` are **generated views**. Each carries","+  a `.generated-by-sync-to-codex` manifest. Every entry **in the manifest** must be","+  a symlink on Mac (a copy on Windows); wrong representation is drift.","+- Entries **not** in the manifest are third-party installs (`npx skills add`).","+  They are counted and reported, **never** flagged as errors and never pruned.","+- Support directories (`_shared/`) have no SKILL.md and must never be pruned.","+","+## Direction of travel","+","+**Fewer skills, stricter rules.** Skills get deleted; rules get sharpened."]}],"created":true}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/rot.md"]}},"classifierMetaLines":"{\"meta\":{\"repoVisibility\":{\"remote\":\"erash11/KeystoneOS\",\"branch\":\"main\",\"visibility\":\"private\"}}}\n","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"837250b6-ec61-4de7-b468-4703cd9418b1","session_id":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS","sessionId":"c59d1788-5ebe-4b20-81a1-9007c16d8649","version":"2.1.269","gitBranch":"main","slug":"replicated-greeting-planet"}
